{
  "sequence_id": "seq_ac5793f8168efdd1",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Don't get careless."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "SASSAN..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Rank 1 SASAKI."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "WE MADE IT..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I'm going to finish him off."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "No."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "\"Do not inflict more pain than necessary\" is a part of the Ghoul Countermeasures code, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "and we also might be able to get infor- nation out of him..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Article 13, Clause 2!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "....more importantly!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I told you not to take action on your own, didn't I....!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I was with Urie- KUN."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Don't make petty distinctions"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Shirazu-Kun, you're injured, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "We produced results though."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "For argument's sake, even if we do get hit, we'll heal sooner or later anyhow, right?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Though in my case, that'd take some time."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "If we follow things like \"Article 13\","
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Then Ghouls will never be eliminated from this world."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Rank 1 SASAKI."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Hold on!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T13",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Squad Leader ... Urie- Kun...!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T14",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T15",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "The quinx have \"experimen- Tal bodies\" so to speak."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T16",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "They are humans who had their natural enemy's \"should power\" insert- ed into them."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T17",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "and the one leading them is ____"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Rank 1 Investi- Gator Saski."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "\"Should won't be eliminated\", huh...?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "SBSON: Haise (ez) [bank Investigation] means to be on as kg"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "— At the same time,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "the ghoul named Kobayashi who Rank 2 Urie had suspected of being \"Torso\" and faced off against..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "\"was not\" Torso."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "The real Torso was"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Ahh,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "My lover"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "TA TAPT"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Tap"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "absorbed in the admiration of his \"Harvest\"."
    }
  ],
